        "original_id": "cac1c996-31ae-56b0-8ad2-7b2087e3d16a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steve Wynn, Tom Fazio\n- Places: Las Vegas Strip, Paradise Nevada, North Las Vegas Nevada, Atlantic City, Mississippi\n- Properties: Golden Nugget, Golden Nugget Atlantic City, The Mirage, Treasure Island Hotel and Casino, Bellagio, Beau Rivage, Shadow Creek Golf Course\n- Topics: casino resorts, golf courses, Las Vegas development\n\nFacts:\n- In 1989, Steve Wynn built Shadow Creek, an 18-hole golf course in North Las Vegas, Nevada, and Tom Fazio designed it.\n- Early in his career, Steve Wynn oversaw the construction and operation of the Golden Nugget, the Golden Nugget Atlantic City, The Mirage, Treasure Island, the Bellagio, and Beau Rivage in Mississippi.\n- In the 1990s, Steve Wynn played a pivotal role in the resurgence and expansion of the Las Vegas Strip.\n- Treasure Island Hotel & Casino is a hotel and casino on the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada, with 2,664 rooms and 220 suites.\n- Treasure Island Hotel & Casino is connected by tram to The Mirage and by pedestrian bridge to the Fashion Show Mall shopping center.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
